@startuml
title Smart Urban Council Complaint Management System - Context
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

actor Citizen
actor "Department Account" as Department
actor Administrator

rectangle "Complaint Management Platform" as Platform
cloud "Google Gemini API" as Gemini
cloud "OpenStreetMap Tile Services" as OSM
rectangle "Authorized Council Documents\n[NEEDS CONFIRMATION]" as Documents

Citizen --> Platform : Submit and track complaints\nUse grounded chatbot
Department --> Platform : Process assigned complaints\nRequest reassignment
Administrator --> Platform : Configure and monitor\nReview AI and reassignments
Platform --> Gemini : Classification and grounded generation
Platform --> OSM : Map tiles and map context
Documents --> Platform : Approved knowledge content

note bottom of Platform
  Proposed system; not claimed as
  officially adopted or deployed.
end note
@enduml

